<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>让上次结果改变下次行动 —— 前提是单次运行是受控的</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 42, fontWeight: 500, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.3}}>触发 · 验证<br />停止 · 记忆</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 18}}>让上次结果改变下次行动</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14}}>前提是：单次运行是受控的。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.05)", borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.75}}>loop &#123;</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.75}}>  act()              # 触发动作</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.75}}>  verify()           # 验证：不过就不许往下</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.75}}>  if !pass: stop()   # 停止条件依赖上次结果</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.75}}>  remember()         # 记忆</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.75}}>&#125;</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "#0F6E56"}}>有 verify()，且停止条件依赖上次结果</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8}}>上次结果改变下次行动——这才叫 loop。</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "#A32D2D"}}>停止条件不依赖上次结果</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8}}>同一个动作重跑一遍——那叫重试，不叫 loop。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>09 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
